  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>Six years working the flats on the moon&#39;s schedule rather than the star&#39;s, from a moored raft that drifted eleven kilometres over the posting and was left where it stopped. The programme recorded the bench-by-bench division of the shelving ground, the terms for each state of the tide, and a rota that turns out to be older than the settlement using it. Its material return was refused twice by the deposit office before a custodian could be named, which delayed publication by four years.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    }
